    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d314-a16">

                <pb facs="0749" n="665" xml:id="pg665"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Republic of Mexico,<lb/>Constitutional Government of the Free and
                                Sovereign State of Sonora</hi></placeName>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">seal.</hi>]</p>
                <p>I, Luis E. Torres, constitutional governor of Sonora, do hereby certify that the
                    foregoing signature of citizen J. M. Torres, prefect of the district of
                    Moctezuma, is his signature as affixed by him to all of his public documents,
                    and this certificate is given by me that full faith and credit may be given by
                    all concerned.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName>Herrnosillo</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1886-04-21">April 21, 1888</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>LUIS E, TORRES.</signed><lb/>Attest:<lb/><signed>RAMON CORRAL,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
